<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Oct c/a deficit $20 mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Oct c/a deficit $20 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account deficit narrowed to $20 million in October from $38 million September, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Hungary had a surplus of $120 million in October 1995.</p>
<p>The accumulated deficit was $1.124 billion in January-October compared to $2.156 billion in the same ten months of 1995, it said.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY C/A BALANCE (in million dollars)</p>
<p>    Oct 96	Sept 96     Jan-Oct 96    Jan-Oct 96</p>
<p>     -20	   -38	    -1,124	  -2,156</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
